```Title: <Detection title> (CIM Endpoint.Processes)```
```ATT&CK: Txxxx.xxx | Severity: medium```
```Data source: CIM Endpoint.Processes data model. summariesonly=false works without acceleration; set true once the data model is accelerated.```
```False positives: <benign causes>```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on host + command line, notable severity medium.```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as firstTime max(_time) as lastTime
    from datamodel=Endpoint.Processes
    where Processes.process_name="example.exe" AND Processes.process="*<value>*"
    by Processes.dest Processes.user Processes.parent_process_name Processes.process_name Processes.process
| rename Processes.* as *
| convert ctime(firstTime) ctime(lastTime)
